Installing K3s

First check your IP address:

->hostname -i

Use that IP in the installation command.

->curl -sfL https://get.k3s.io | \
INSTALL_K3S_EXEC="server \
--node-ip=172.20.10.3 \
--flannel-iface=enp0s3 \
--disable traefik \
--disable servicelb" \
